# Keep the build context small and avoid copying host build artifacts into the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Flutter apps aren't part of the API image.
aimpark_admin/
aimpark_mobile/

# Never ship credentials or local-only config into an image.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/google-services.json
.env

.git/
.gitignore
.github/
**/*.md
MD files/
